cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Netresearch Open Source Impact
message: >-
  If you use these figures, cite the dated snapshot you read rather than the
  dashboard, which is overwritten every day.
type: dataset
abstract: >-
  Daily measurements of activity across the public repositories of the
  Netresearch DTT GmbH GitHub organisation: repositories, releases,
  contributors, external contributors, issues, pull requests, commits, package
  and container downloads, dependent repositories, and — where a token with the
  required scope is available — repository traffic. Collected from the GitHub
  REST API, the GitHub dependency graph, Packagist and the GitHub Container
  Registry. Each run is archived at a permanent URL.
authors:
  - name: Netresearch DTT GmbH
    website: 'https://www.netresearch.de/'
    city: Leipzig
    country: DE
repository-code: 'https://github.com/netresearch/maint'
url: 'https://netresearch.github.io/maint/'
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - open source
  - software metrics
  - TYPO3
  - impact measurement
